**Predictive and Mitigation Techniques:**
- **Real-Time Interference Prediction**: Machine learning models can be trained to predict interference levels based on historical data and real-time environmental conditions. This can help in dynamically adjusting the beamforming and precoding parameters to mitigate interference.
