To address this challenge, lightweight machine learning algorithms and model compression techniques can be employed. For instance, pruning and quantization can reduce the computational complexity of deep learning models without significantly affecting their performance. Additionally, edge computing can be utilized to offload some of the processing to ground stations, reducing the computational load on the satellite.

